# Fetched corpora and run artifacts. Both are outputs, not sources.
#
# The corpora are a build input in the shape the vendored embedding model already is
# (ADR-0024 §4, `.gitignore` at the root): fetched from a pinned revision, verified
# against a recorded SHA-256, never committed. LoCoMo is additionally CC BY-NC 4.0, so
# committing it would be redistributing someone else's data under this repository's
# licence — see `memory/corpora/provenance.py`.
#
# Runs hold per-case SQLite stores and JSONL records, which are measurements. They
# belong wherever the write-up keeps its evidence, not in the history.
.corpora/
.runs/
